  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Statistics II: mean from a frequency table</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core and Essential 3.1: Find the total frequency, the sum of fx and the mean from a frequency table.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project and does not come from Cassell, D., Instone, S., Ling, J., Scruton, P. and Shilton, S., SMP AS/A2 Mathematics: Statistics 1 for Edexcel, Cambridge University Press, 2004.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
